    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1749832166\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1749832166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1749832166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/df06f9161e072b1bb7ea394373d82f0f.avif?t=1749832166\" /></span><br><br><strong>Living Cell</strong> is a dark adventure game with elements of survival in a <strong>Samosbor setting</strong>.<br>Explore the living block room by room, avoid poisonous slimes and make sure that the filters of the gas mask do not die ahead of time, and the flashlight continues to work.<br>Learn about the frightening stories of the inhabitants of Gigakhrushchyovka by exploring their everyday life and surroundings.<br><br><i>Survive or become another consumable whose body will go to food concentrate after death.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/f090250399b7ea80f6e7cbd5eafab238.avif?t=1749832166\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/60bad0e316f8044d140dc70511dec649.avif?t=1749832166\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique setting</strong> based on the Gigakhrushchyovka and Samosbor universe<br></li><li><strong>Gloomy and oppressive atmospher</strong> of despair and decay<br></li><li><strong>Unusual gameplay</strong> combining elements of a quest, survival and various puzzles</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/0f5e00b022ebd0ce741bebdb02ec1f8d.avif?t=1749832166\" /></span>",
